  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "jnUL6zD8EOYuo5j0Qk+9B9N6OE4=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:26:59.864Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "Evolutio is in the priority-4 pool without either of the facts that pool is meant to sort on. Its v2 verticals are recorded as \"not resolved\" and its tool field as \"not researched\". The row is a provisional carry-over from the tail of the v2 ranking, rescored mechanically on size and slot occupancy alone.\n\nWith the stack unknown, only one of those two scoring inputs could actually have been computed. Slot occupancy cannot be assessed against a blank platform field, which leaves size as the effective determinant of the rank. That makes priority 4 a statement about how big the company is and nothing else.\n\nThis is a research task rather than a lead. The honest next step is the OSS-portfolio screen the flag asks for plus a vertical resolution pass; until one of those produces something, there is no claim about Evolutio to act on.\n\n---\n\n## Leads sharing this finding (1)\n\n**4 \u00b7 needs OSS screen**\n- Evolutio (ES)\n\nVerbatim research text this claim was extracted from:\n\n> DERIVED, NOT SCORED ON v3 \u2014 v2 row rescored mechanically (size + slot-occupancy only). Run the OSS-portfolio screen before acting. v2 verticals: not resolved",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-19T11:26:59.864839Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:26:59.864844Z"
    }
  },
